{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L67","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:67"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Text adapter interface with pre-resolved generics."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An adapter is created by a provider function: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"provider('model')"},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"adapter"},{"type":"text","value":"\nAll type resolution happens at the provider call site, not in this interface."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generic parameters:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TModel: The specific model name (e.g., 'gpt-4o')"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TProviderOptions: Provider-specific options for this model (already resolved)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TInputModalities: Supported input modalities for this model (already resolved)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TMessageMetadata: Metadata types for content parts (already resolved)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TToolCapabilities: Tuple of tool-kind strings supported by this model, resolved from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"supports.tools"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TToolCallMetadata: Metadata type that round-trips with tool calls (e.g. Gemini's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"thoughtSignature"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSystemPromptMetadata: Provider-typed metadata accepted on each\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"systemPrompts[i]"},{"type":"text","value":" entry (e.g. Anthropic "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cache_control"},{"type":"text","value":"). Defaults to\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"},{"type":"text","value":" — adapters without per-prompt metadata reject the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"metadata"},{"type":"text","value":"\nfield at the call site."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tmodel","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TModel"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TModel"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tprovideroptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TProviderOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProviderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Record"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tinputmodalities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TInputModalities"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TInputModalities"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReadonlyArray"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/Modality.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Modality"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tmessagemetadatabymodality","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TMessageMetadataByModality"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TMessageMetadataByModality"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultMessageMetadataByModality.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultMessageMetadataByModality"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ttoolcapabilities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TToolCapabilities"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TToolCapabilities"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReadonlyArray"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":"> = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReadonlyArray"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ttoolcallmetadata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TToolCallMetadata"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TToolCallMetadata"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tsystempromptmetadata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSystemPromptMetadata"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSystemPromptMetadata"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"types","children":[{"type":"text","value":"~types"}]},{"type":"code","value":"~types: object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L104","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:104"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Internal"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-only properties for inference. Not assigned at runtime."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inputmodalities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"inputModalities"}]},{"type":"code","value":"inputModalities: TInputModalities;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"messagemetadatabymodality","children":[{"type":"text","value":"messageMetadataByModality"}]},{"type":"code","value":"messageMetadataByModality: TMessageMetadataByModality;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"provideroptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"providerOptions"}]},{"type":"code","value":"providerOptions: TProviderOptions;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"systempromptmetadata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"systemPromptMetadata"}]},{"type":"code","value":"systemPromptMetadata: TSystemPromptMetadata;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"toolcallmetadata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"toolCallMetadata"}]},{"type":"code","value":"toolCallMetadata: TToolCallMetadata;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"toolcapabilities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"toolCapabilities"}]},{"type":"code","value":"toolCapabilities: TToolCapabilities;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"chatstream","children":[{"type":"text","value":"chatStream"}]},{"type":"code","value":"chatStream: (options) => AsyncIterable<AdapterYieldChunk>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L116","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:116"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Stream text completions from the model"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"TextOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TextOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProviderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AsyncIterable"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AdapterYieldChunk.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AdapterYieldChunk"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"combinedstructuredoutputsource","children":[{"type":"text","value":"combinedStructuredOutputSource?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional combinedStructuredOutputSource?: (modelOptions?) => \"text\" | \"event\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L183","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:183"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Where native-combined structured output is taken from."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'text'"},{"type":"text","value":" (default when omitted): the agent loop's accumulated\nassistant text is schema JSON. The engine parses it after the loop.\nHTTP adapters use this."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'event'"},{"type":"text","value":": the adapter emits "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"structured-output.complete"},{"type":"text","value":" during\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chatStream"},{"type":"text","value":". The engine must not parse accumulated prose. Harness\nadapters use this."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"modeloptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"modelOptions?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProviderOptions"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"text\""},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"event\""}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"kind","children":[{"type":"text","value":"kind"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly kind: \"text\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L77","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:77"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Discriminator for adapter kind"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly model: TModel;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L81","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:81"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The model this adapter is configured for"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"name","children":[{"type":"text","value":"name"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly name: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L79","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:79"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider name identifier (e.g., 'openai', 'anthropic')"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"requires","children":[{"type":"text","value":"requires?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly optional requires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L90","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:90"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Capabilities this adapter requires at runtime. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat()"},{"type":"text","value":" validates that the\nconfigured middleware provides each one. Model adapters omit this; harness\nadapters (e.g. a future "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"claudeCode()"},{"type":"text","value":") declare e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[sandboxCapability]"},{"type":"text","value":".\nRuntime access to capabilities from inside the adapter is not yet wired —\nthis is the declaration/validation surface only."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"structuredoutput","children":[{"type":"text","value":"structuredOutput"}]},{"type":"code","value":"structuredOutput: (options) => Promise<StructuredOutputResult<unknown>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L128","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:128"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generate structured output using the provider's native structured output API.\nThis method uses stream: false and sends the JSON schema to the provider\nto ensure the response conforms to the expected structure."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StructuredOutputOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProviderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Structured output options containing chat options and JSON schema"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StructuredOutputResult"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Promise with the raw data (validation is done in the chat function)"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"structuredoutputstream","children":[{"type":"text","value":"structuredOutputStream?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional structuredOutputStream?: (options) => AsyncIterable<AdapterYieldChunk>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L146","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:146"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Stream structured output using the provider's native streaming structured\noutput API (stream + response_format json_schema in a single request)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional — adapters without native streaming JSON omit this method and the\nactivity layer synthesizes a stream around the non-streaming\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"structuredOutput"},{"type":"text","value":" call."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementations must emit standard AG-UI lifecycle events (RUN_STARTED,\nTEXT_MESSAGE_*, RUN_FINISHED) carrying raw JSON text deltas, plus a final\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CUSTOM"},{"type":"text","value":" event named "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"structured-output.complete"},{"type":"text","value":" whose "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"value"},{"type":"text","value":" is\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ object, raw, reasoning? }"},{"type":"text","value":". Events must be timestamped when emitted so\ntheir timestamps follow stream order."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StructuredOutputOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProviderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AsyncIterable"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AdapterYieldChunk.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AdapterYieldChunk"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"supportscombinedtoolsandschema","children":[{"type":"text","value":"supportsCombinedToolsAndSchema?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional supportsCombinedToolsAndSchema?: (modelOptions?) => boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L169","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:169"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Declares whether the adapter supports combining "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tools"},{"type":"text","value":" and a\nschema-constrained final answer in a single streaming request."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", the engine wires "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"outputSchema"},{"type":"text","value":" into the regular\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chatStream()"},{"type":"text","value":" call and skips the separate "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runStructuredFinalization"},{"type":"text","value":"\nround-trip. The model's natural final turn carries the\nschema-constrained JSON text and the engine harvests it from the agent\nloop's accumulated content."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":", or the method is omitted, the engine runs\nthe agent loop without "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"outputSchema"},{"type":"text","value":" and then issues a separate\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"structuredOutput"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"structuredOutputStream"},{"type":"text","value":" call against the JSON\nschema for finalization (the legacy path)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The method receives the per-call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"modelOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" so providers whose\nsupport depends on the resolved upstream model (e.g. OpenRouter) can\nanswer per-request. Most adapters can return a constant."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"modeloptions-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"modelOptions?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProviderOptions"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"supportsfilesources","children":[{"type":"text","value":"supportsFileSources?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly optional supportsFileSources?: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L99","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:99"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Declares that this adapter can consume "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ type: 'file' }"},{"type":"text","value":" content sources\n(provider Files API references). "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat()"},{"type":"text","value":" rejects file sources in preflight\nfor adapters that don't declare this, so an adapter written before the\nfile arm existed fails closed instead of silently mis-mapping a reference\nonto its URL/data branch."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tmodel","text":"TModel","level":3},{"id":"tprovideroptions","text":"TProviderOptions","level":3},{"id":"tinputmodalities","text":"TInputModalities","level":3},{"id":"tmessagemetadatabymodality","text":"TMessageMetadataByModality","level":3},{"id":"ttoolcapabilities","text":"TToolCapabilities","level":3},{"id":"ttoolcallmetadata","text":"TToolCallMetadata","level":3},{"id":"tsystempromptmetadata","text":"TSystemPromptMetadata","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"types","text":"~types","level":3},{"id":"inputmodalities","text":"inputModalities","level":4},{"id":"messagemetadatabymodality","text":"messageMetadataByModality","level":4},{"id":"provideroptions","text":"providerOptions","level":4},{"id":"systempromptmetadata","text":"systemPromptMetadata","level":4},{"id":"toolcallmetadata","text":"toolCallMetadata","level":4},{"id":"toolcapabilities","text":"toolCapabilities","level":4},{"id":"chatstream","text":"chatStream","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"combinedstructuredoutputsource","text":"combinedStructuredOutputSource?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"modeloptions","text":"modelOptions?","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"kind","text":"kind","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"name","text":"name","level":3},{"id":"requires","text":"requires?","level":3},{"id":"structuredoutput","text":"structuredOutput","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options-2","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"structuredoutputstream","text":"structuredOutputStream?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options-3","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"supportscombinedtoolsandschema","text":"supportsCombinedToolsAndSchema?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-5","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"modeloptions-2","text":"modelOptions?","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"supportsfilesources","text":"supportsFileSources?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:67](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L67)\n\nText adapter interface with pre-resolved generics.\n\nAn adapter is created by a provider function: `provider('model')` → `adapter`\nAll type resolution happens at the provider call site, not in this interface.\n\nGeneric parameters:\n- TModel: The specific model name (e.g., 'gpt-4o')\n- TProviderOptions: Provider-specific options for this model (already resolved)\n- TInputModalities: Supported input modalities for this model (already resolved)\n- TMessageMetadata: Metadata types for content parts (already resolved)\n- TToolCapabilities: Tuple of tool-kind strings supported by this model, resolved from `supports.tools`\n- TToolCallMetadata: Metadata type that round-trips with tool calls (e.g. Gemini's `thoughtSignature`)\n- TSystemPromptMetadata: Provider-typed metadata accepted on each\n  `systemPrompts[i]` entry (e.g. Anthropic `cache_control`). Defaults to\n  `never` — adapters without per-prompt metadata reject the `metadata`\n  field at the call site.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModel\n\n`TModel` *extends* `string`\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, `any`\\>\n\n### TInputModalities\n\n`TInputModalities` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<[`Modality`](../type-aliases/Modality.md)\\>\n\n### TMessageMetadataByModality\n\n`TMessageMetadataByModality` *extends* [`DefaultMessageMetadataByModality`](DefaultMessageMetadataByModality.md)\n\n### TToolCapabilities\n\n`TToolCapabilities` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<`string`\\> = `ReadonlyArray`\\<`string`\\>\n\n### TToolCallMetadata\n\n`TToolCallMetadata` = `unknown`\n\n### TSystemPromptMetadata\n\n`TSystemPromptMetadata` = `never`\n\n## Properties\n\n### ~types\n\n```ts\n~types: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:104](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L104)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nType-only properties for inference. Not assigned at runtime.\n\n#### inputModalities\n\n```ts\ninputModalities: TInputModalities;\n```\n\n#### messageMetadataByModality\n\n```ts\nmessageMetadataByModality: TMessageMetadataByModality;\n```\n\n#### providerOptions\n\n```ts\nproviderOptions: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\n#### systemPromptMetadata\n\n```ts\nsystemPromptMetadata: TSystemPromptMetadata;\n```\n\n#### toolCallMetadata\n\n```ts\ntoolCallMetadata: TToolCallMetadata;\n```\n\n#### toolCapabilities\n\n```ts\ntoolCapabilities: TToolCapabilities;\n```\n\n***\n\n### chatStream\n\n```ts\nchatStream: (options) => AsyncIterable<AdapterYieldChunk>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:116](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L116)\n\nStream text completions from the model\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`TextOptions`](TextOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AdapterYieldChunk`](../type-aliases/AdapterYieldChunk.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### combinedStructuredOutputSource?\n\n```ts\noptional combinedStructuredOutputSource?: (modelOptions?) => \"text\" | \"event\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:183](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L183)\n\nWhere native-combined structured output is taken from.\n\n- `'text'` (default when omitted): the agent loop's accumulated\n  assistant text is schema JSON. The engine parses it after the loop.\n  HTTP adapters use this.\n- `'event'`: the adapter emits `structured-output.complete` during\n  `chatStream`. The engine must not parse accumulated prose. Harness\n  adapters use this.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### modelOptions?\n\n`TProviderOptions`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`\"text\"` \\| `\"event\"`\n\n***\n\n### kind\n\n```ts\nreadonly kind: \"text\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:77](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L77)\n\nDiscriminator for adapter kind\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nreadonly model: TModel;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:81](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L81)\n\nThe model this adapter is configured for\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nreadonly name: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:79](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L79)\n\nProvider name identifier (e.g., 'openai', 'anthropic')\n\n***\n\n### requires?\n\n```ts\nreadonly optional requires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:90](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L90)\n\nCapabilities this adapter requires at runtime. `chat()` validates that the\nconfigured middleware provides each one. Model adapters omit this; harness\nadapters (e.g. a future `claudeCode()`) declare e.g. `[sandboxCapability]`.\nRuntime access to capabilities from inside the adapter is not yet wired —\nthis is the declaration/validation surface only.\n\n***\n\n### structuredOutput\n\n```ts\nstructuredOutput: (options) => Promise<StructuredOutputResult<unknown>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:128](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L128)\n\nGenerate structured output using the provider's native structured output API.\nThis method uses stream: false and sends the JSON schema to the provider\nto ensure the response conforms to the expected structure.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`StructuredOutputOptions`\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\nStructured output options containing chat options and JSON schema\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`StructuredOutputResult`\\<`unknown`\\>\\>\n\nPromise with the raw data (validation is done in the chat function)\n\n***\n\n### structuredOutputStream?\n\n```ts\noptional structuredOutputStream?: (options) => AsyncIterable<AdapterYieldChunk>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:146](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L146)\n\nStream structured output using the provider's native streaming structured\noutput API (stream + response_format json_schema in a single request).\n\nOptional — adapters without native streaming JSON omit this method and the\nactivity layer synthesizes a stream around the non-streaming\n`structuredOutput` call.\n\nImplementations must emit standard AG-UI lifecycle events (RUN_STARTED,\nTEXT_MESSAGE_*, RUN_FINISHED) carrying raw JSON text deltas, plus a final\n`CUSTOM` event named `structured-output.complete` whose `value` is\n`{ object, raw, reasoning? }`. Events must be timestamped when emitted so\ntheir timestamps follow stream order.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`StructuredOutputOptions`\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AdapterYieldChunk`](../type-aliases/AdapterYieldChunk.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### supportsCombinedToolsAndSchema?\n\n```ts\noptional supportsCombinedToolsAndSchema?: (modelOptions?) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:169](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L169)\n\nDeclares whether the adapter supports combining `tools` and a\nschema-constrained final answer in a single streaming request.\n\nWhen `true`, the engine wires `outputSchema` into the regular\n`chatStream()` call and skips the separate `runStructuredFinalization`\nround-trip. The model's natural final turn carries the\nschema-constrained JSON text and the engine harvests it from the agent\nloop's accumulated content.\n\nWhen `false`, `undefined`, or the method is omitted, the engine runs\nthe agent loop without `outputSchema` and then issues a separate\n`structuredOutput` / `structuredOutputStream` call against the JSON\nschema for finalization (the legacy path).\n\nThe method receives the per-call `modelOptions` so providers whose\nsupport depends on the resolved upstream model (e.g. OpenRouter) can\nanswer per-request. Most adapters can return a constant.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### modelOptions?\n\n`TProviderOptions`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n***\n\n### supportsFileSources?\n\n```ts\nreadonly optional supportsFileSources?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:99](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L99)\n\nDeclares that this adapter can consume `{ type: 'file' }` content sources\n(provider Files API references). `chat()` rejects file sources in preflight\nfor adapters that don't declare this, so an adapter written before the\nfile arm existed fails closed instead of silently mis-mapping a reference\nonto its URL/data branch.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TextAdapter\ntitle: TextAdapter\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:67](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L67)\n\nText adapter interface with pre-resolved generics.\n\nAn adapter is created by a provider function: `provider('model')` → `adapter`\nAll type resolution happens at the provider call site, not in this interface.\n\nGeneric parameters:\n- TModel: The specific model name (e.g., 'gpt-4o')\n- TProviderOptions: Provider-specific options for this model (already resolved)\n- TInputModalities: Supported input modalities for this model (already resolved)\n- TMessageMetadata: Metadata types for content parts (already resolved)\n- TToolCapabilities: Tuple of tool-kind strings supported by this model, resolved from `supports.tools`\n- TToolCallMetadata: Metadata type that round-trips with tool calls (e.g. Gemini's `thoughtSignature`)\n- TSystemPromptMetadata: Provider-typed metadata accepted on each\n  `systemPrompts[i]` entry (e.g. Anthropic `cache_control`). Defaults to\n  `never` — adapters without per-prompt metadata reject the `metadata`\n  field at the call site.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModel\n\n`TModel` *extends* `string`\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, `any`\\>\n\n### TInputModalities\n\n`TInputModalities` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<[`Modality`](../type-aliases/Modality.md)\\>\n\n### TMessageMetadataByModality\n\n`TMessageMetadataByModality` *extends* [`DefaultMessageMetadataByModality`](DefaultMessageMetadataByModality.md)\n\n### TToolCapabilities\n\n`TToolCapabilities` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<`string`\\> = `ReadonlyArray`\\<`string`\\>\n\n### TToolCallMetadata\n\n`TToolCallMetadata` = `unknown`\n\n### TSystemPromptMetadata\n\n`TSystemPromptMetadata` = `never`\n\n## Properties\n\n### ~types\n\n```ts\n~types: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:104](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L104)\n\n**`Internal`**\n\nType-only properties for inference. Not assigned at runtime.\n\n#### inputModalities\n\n```ts\ninputModalities: TInputModalities;\n```\n\n#### messageMetadataByModality\n\n```ts\nmessageMetadataByModality: TMessageMetadataByModality;\n```\n\n#### providerOptions\n\n```ts\nproviderOptions: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\n#### systemPromptMetadata\n\n```ts\nsystemPromptMetadata: TSystemPromptMetadata;\n```\n\n#### toolCallMetadata\n\n```ts\ntoolCallMetadata: TToolCallMetadata;\n```\n\n#### toolCapabilities\n\n```ts\ntoolCapabilities: TToolCapabilities;\n```\n\n***\n\n### chatStream\n\n```ts\nchatStream: (options) => AsyncIterable<AdapterYieldChunk>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:116](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L116)\n\nStream text completions from the model\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n[`TextOptions`](TextOptions.md)\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AdapterYieldChunk`](../type-aliases/AdapterYieldChunk.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### combinedStructuredOutputSource?\n\n```ts\noptional combinedStructuredOutputSource?: (modelOptions?) => \"text\" | \"event\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:183](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L183)\n\nWhere native-combined structured output is taken from.\n\n- `'text'` (default when omitted): the agent loop's accumulated\n  assistant text is schema JSON. The engine parses it after the loop.\n  HTTP adapters use this.\n- `'event'`: the adapter emits `structured-output.complete` during\n  `chatStream`. The engine must not parse accumulated prose. Harness\n  adapters use this.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### modelOptions?\n\n`TProviderOptions`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`\"text\"` \\| `\"event\"`\n\n***\n\n### kind\n\n```ts\nreadonly kind: \"text\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:77](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L77)\n\nDiscriminator for adapter kind\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nreadonly model: TModel;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:81](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L81)\n\nThe model this adapter is configured for\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nreadonly name: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:79](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L79)\n\nProvider name identifier (e.g., 'openai', 'anthropic')\n\n***\n\n### requires?\n\n```ts\nreadonly optional requires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:90](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L90)\n\nCapabilities this adapter requires at runtime. `chat()` validates that the\nconfigured middleware provides each one. Model adapters omit this; harness\nadapters (e.g. a future `claudeCode()`) declare e.g. `[sandboxCapability]`.\nRuntime access to capabilities from inside the adapter is not yet wired —\nthis is the declaration/validation surface only.\n\n***\n\n### structuredOutput\n\n```ts\nstructuredOutput: (options) => Promise<StructuredOutputResult<unknown>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:128](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L128)\n\nGenerate structured output using the provider's native structured output API.\nThis method uses stream: false and sends the JSON schema to the provider\nto ensure the response conforms to the expected structure.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`StructuredOutputOptions`\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\nStructured output options containing chat options and JSON schema\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`StructuredOutputResult`\\<`unknown`\\>\\>\n\nPromise with the raw data (validation is done in the chat function)\n\n***\n\n### structuredOutputStream?\n\n```ts\noptional structuredOutputStream?: (options) => AsyncIterable<AdapterYieldChunk>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:146](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L146)\n\nStream structured output using the provider's native streaming structured\noutput API (stream + response_format json_schema in a single request).\n\nOptional — adapters without native streaming JSON omit this method and the\nactivity layer synthesizes a stream around the non-streaming\n`structuredOutput` call.\n\nImplementations must emit standard AG-UI lifecycle events (RUN_STARTED,\nTEXT_MESSAGE_*, RUN_FINISHED) carrying raw JSON text deltas, plus a final\n`CUSTOM` event named `structured-output.complete` whose `value` is\n`{ object, raw, reasoning? }`. Events must be timestamped when emitted so\ntheir timestamps follow stream order.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`StructuredOutputOptions`\\<`TProviderOptions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AdapterYieldChunk`](../type-aliases/AdapterYieldChunk.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### supportsCombinedToolsAndSchema?\n\n```ts\noptional supportsCombinedToolsAndSchema?: (modelOptions?) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:169](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L169)\n\nDeclares whether the adapter supports combining `tools` and a\nschema-constrained final answer in a single streaming request.\n\nWhen `true`, the engine wires `outputSchema` into the regular\n`chatStream()` call and skips the separate `runStructuredFinalization`\nround-trip. The model's natural final turn carries the\nschema-constrained JSON text and the engine harvests it from the agent\nloop's accumulated content.\n\nWhen `false`, `undefined`, or the method is omitted, the engine runs\nthe agent loop without `outputSchema` and then issues a separate\n`structuredOutput` / `structuredOutputStream` call against the JSON\nschema for finalization (the legacy path).\n\nThe method receives the per-call `modelOptions` so providers whose\nsupport depends on the resolved upstream model (e.g. OpenRouter) can\nanswer per-request. Most adapters can return a constant.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### modelOptions?\n\n`TProviderOptions`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n***\n\n### supportsFileSources?\n\n```ts\nreadonly optional supportsFileSources?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts:99](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/adapter.ts#L99)\n\nDeclares that this adapter can consume `{ type: 'file' }` content sources\n(provider Files API references). `chat()` rejects file sources in preflight\nfor adapters that don't declare this, so an adapter written before the\nfile arm existed fails closed instead of silently mis-mapping a reference\nonto its URL/data branch.\n"}
